Dynamic Programming is used decrease the Time Complexity of any Recursive Code.

1. Memoization(Top Down DP):- It basically means storing the value of the previous calls.
    Eg:- Fibonacci takes the complexity of O(2^n) to find the nth fibonacci.
         By Using DP, we store the value of a call in a array and takes the value form the array for further use.

2. Tabulation(Bottom Up DP):- Using Previous answers to calculate new answers.